graph TB
    subgraph Client["🌐 Client Layer"]
        Browser["Browser<br/>User Device"]
    end

    subgraph Edge["⚡ Edge Layer<br/>Cloudflare Workers"]
        SSR["TanStack Start<br/>Server-Side Rendering"]
        Router["TanStack Router<br/>File-based Routes"]
    end

    subgraph Components["⚛️ Component Layer"]
        Pages["Pages<br/>index.tsx | login.tsx<br/>dashboard.tsx | courses.tsx"]
        UI["UI Components<br/>Radix UI + Tailwind CSS"]
    end

    subgraph State["📦 State Management"]
        Query["TanStack Query<br/>Data Cache & Sync"]
        Hooks["React Hooks<br/>UI State"]
    end

    subgraph API["🔐 API Layer"]
        Firebase["Firebase Auth<br/>Token Management"]
        Fetch["Fetch Client<br/>Bearer Token"]
    end

    subgraph Backend["🖥️ Backend Spring Boot"]
        Endpoints["API Endpoints<br/>GET /courses<br/>POST /enrollments<br/>GET /progress"]
    end

    subgraph Database["💾 Data Layer"]
        DB["PostgreSQL<br/>Users, Courses, Enrollments"]
    end

    Browser -->|HTTP/HTTPS| SSR
    SSR -->|Hydration| Pages
    Pages -->|Render| UI
    UI -->|Re-render| Browser

    UI -->|useQuery/useMutation| Query
    Query -->|Cache hits| Hooks
    Query -->|Fetch API| Fetch

    Browser -->|Firebase.auth| Firebase
    Firebase -->|ID Token| Fetch
    Fetch -->|Authorization: Bearer| Endpoints

    Endpoints -->|SQL Query| DB
    DB -->|Response| Endpoints
    Endpoints -->|JSON Response| Fetch